WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.042 --> 00:00:01.962
- We're playing Telephone Pictionary!

00:00:01.962 --> 00:00:04.577
(upbeat music)

00:00:04.577 --> 00:00:05.755
Here's how it works, we're taking a

00:00:05.755 --> 00:00:06.841
news story and having someone

00:00:06.841 --> 00:00:07.717
draw out that news story.

00:00:07.717 --> 00:00:09.036
We'll take that picture to someone else

00:00:09.036 --> 00:00:10.679
and have them try and
guess what the story says.

00:00:10.679 --> 00:00:11.934
Then we'll move on to another person

00:00:11.934 --> 00:00:13.462
to try and draw out the same story.

00:00:13.462 --> 00:00:14.265
Confused?

00:00:14.265 --> 00:00:16.188
Not to worry, but here's today's story.

00:00:16.188 --> 00:00:17.598
(upbeat music)

00:00:17.598 --> 00:00:19.313
Tickets for the new movie
went on sale this week,

00:00:19.313 --> 00:00:21.273
shattering "Hunger Games" sales records.

00:00:21.273 --> 00:00:23.348
(upbeat music)

00:00:23.348 --> 00:00:26.111
- Star Wars stuff,
Darth Vader, lightsaber,

00:00:26.111 --> 00:00:27.820
monies, monies, monies!

00:00:27.820 --> 00:00:30.356
- Some sort of welder
or radioactive engineers

00:00:30.356 --> 00:00:31.816
helmet being hit with a bat.

00:00:31.816 --> 00:00:33.483
Oh this is definitely Star Wars!

00:00:33.483 --> 00:00:36.486
I got my tickets, I got my
tickets for "Star Wars."

00:00:36.486 --> 00:00:37.447
I'm seeing it!

00:00:37.447 --> 00:00:39.127
- I have to draw it now?
- No words, no words!

00:00:39.127 --> 00:00:40.011
- Dammit!

00:00:40.011 --> 00:00:42.919
(laughter)

00:00:42.919 --> 00:00:45.088
That's Yoda, that's Chewbacca,

00:00:45.088 --> 00:00:47.374
and money is spewing
out of his lightsaber.

00:00:47.374 --> 00:00:50.093
- Clearly like, ghost cat money,

00:00:50.093 --> 00:00:52.216
dog cat money is not a news story.

00:00:52.216 --> 00:00:53.929
- (laughs) Are you sure?

00:00:53.929 --> 00:00:55.515
- I don't know, I'm not sure.

00:00:55.515 --> 00:00:57.266
I'm not sure of anything right now.

00:00:57.266 --> 00:01:00.594
The best kind of money, cat dog money.

00:01:00.594 --> 00:01:02.512
- Ned wins so far!

00:01:02.512 --> 00:01:04.892
- I don't even know
where to start (laughs)!

00:01:04.892 --> 00:01:07.392
(upbeat music)

00:01:07.392 --> 00:01:09.987
- What is this (laughs)?

00:01:09.987 --> 00:01:13.105
Um, I think that's poop.

00:01:13.105 --> 00:01:16.369
Yes, cats + poop face = money?

00:01:16.369 --> 00:01:17.579
I mean I wouldn't be surprised

00:01:17.579 --> 00:01:20.081
with half the headlines you see nowadays.

00:01:20.081 --> 00:01:25.081
(upbeat music)

00:01:28.005 --> 00:01:29.548
- And that was the game,
Telephone Pictionary.

00:01:29.548 --> 00:01:31.843
Try it at home, tell us what you get.

00:01:31.843 --> 00:01:34.220
Hopefully not cat poop face money.

00:01:34.220 --> 00:01:36.190
I don't know, sorry Star Wars.

